{
  "description": "Partitions of the nightly mutation sweep (#668). One Stryker run over all 9358 generator mutants does not fit a job, so mutation.yml runs one matrix job per partition and MutationSummary.cs merges the reports. Strings are Stryker --mutate globs. A {\"file\", \"lines\": [first, last]} entry mutates only those lines of one file (omit last for the end of the file); the workflow converts it to the character span Stryker expects. A partition with \"rest\": true mutates every file of its project that no other partition of that project claims, so a new source file is always mutated somewhere. MutationSummary.cs fails when a partition's report is missing, covers no mutant, or claims a mutant another partition also tested. See docs/internals/mutation-testing.md before changing the split.",
